<title>UK: Maunders appoints new finance director.</title>
<headline>Maunders appoints new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Maunders Group Plc announced it had appointed Alun Evans group financial director to replace Geoffrey Swarbrick, who retired in June due to ill health.</p>
<p>Evans, 41, has been finance director of Lambert Howarth Group Plc for the past six years.</p>
